Subject: [PATCH 05/11] =?UTF-8?q?E2-familjen:=20inbromsningsregeln=20sp?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=A4rrar=20bara=20ett=20nytt=20intr=C3=A4de=20i=20strax?=
